      "v": "hicham",
      "t": "Qu'est-ce que tu fais, là?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'What are you doing here?' Hicham storms into Mathias's office demanding answers.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "mathias",
      "t": "Mais calme-toi, s'il te plaît.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Calm down, please.' Mathias tries to soothe his furious partner.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "hicham",
      "t": "C'est quoi ce terrible désordre?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'What is this terrible mess?' Hicham demands an explanation of the chaos.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "hicham",
      "t": "Andréa veut partir avec Gabriel?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Andrea wants to leave with Gabriel?' Hicham confirms the identities of the defecting agents.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "hicham",
      "t": "Monter une autre agence concurrente?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Start another competing agency?' Hicham cannot believe they plan to set up a rival company.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "hicham",
      "t": "Ce n'est pas possible!",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'This cannot be possible!' Hicham reacts with sheer disbelief to the revelation.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "hicham",
      "t": "Je suis complètement écœuré aujourd'hui.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I am completely disgusted today.' Hicham confesses his deep personal revulsion at their disloyalty.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "mathias",
      "t": "Je te comprends parfaitement, Hicham.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I understand you perfectly, Hicham.' Mathias adopts a sympathetic tone to gain his confidence.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "mathias",
      "t": "Ma proposition tient toujours, sache-le.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'My offer still stands, know that.' Mathias brings back his buyout proposal.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "hicham",
      "t": "Tu veux acheter mes parts?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You want to buy out my shares?' Hicham clarifies Mathias's intentions.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "mathias",
      "t": "Je veux te libérer enfin.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I want to free you at last.' Mathias frames the buyout as liberating Hicham from unwanted stress.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "mathias",
      "t": "Tes associés te trahissent lâchement.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Your partners betray you cowardly.' Mathias drives a wedge between Hicham and his associates.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "hicham",
      "t": "Et avec toi, ce sera différent?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'And with you, it will be different?' Hicham questions whether Mathias is truly trustworthy.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "mathias",
      "t": "ASK, c'est mon agence.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
